   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1afde7775f24092c2b91",
   "sourceHash": "1afde7775f24092c2b91ee881df9c15fb532784359b32fb10e6d196f012e7d7e",
   "text": "基查里（Kitchari）：由大米、扁豆和香料调制而成的滋养餐食，对消化系统温和，非常适合排毒。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_83ced03dfec55eddb0f7",
   "sourceHash": "83ced03dfec55eddb0f715b2f8a0b2450597bb55d60e64fa07c19144e37c181d",
   "text": "草本茶",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ff6fdb5c9f95c0ced4b8",
   "sourceHash": "ff6fdb5c9f95c0ced4b8f810ea2988f733e7cb808e8e5eac6302363020b5d65d",
   "text": "：以圣罗勒（tulsi）、南非醉茄（ashwagandha）和积雪草（Brahmi）等阿育吠陀草药冲泡，有助于增强免疫力并促进放松。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_48412ff552c5512ec9cf",
   "sourceHash": "48412ff552c5512ec9cf72e62a531a6447bc75fe109d3f94fdd64a3912c76e95",
   "text": "草本茶：以圣罗勒（tulsi）、南非醉茄（ashwagandha）和积雪草（Brahmi）等阿育吠陀草药冲泡，有助于增强免疫力并促进放松。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8a76f0ebca0907a07e81",
   "sourceHash": "8a76f0ebca0907a07e8160ae213e762225eb411660c72a508fb5b4d1f2e0f570",
   "text": "时令蔬菜咖喱",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9b2d8d29968dccf780c0",
   "sourceHash": "9b2d8d29968dccf780c01aafc215c08a66e83cf12fdb409d0a6d8b7aac576164",
   "text": "：选用新鲜采摘的蔬菜，并以适合不同体质（dosha）的香料调味。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d4e22d0d2fbd3433f2a8",
   "sourceHash": "d4e22d0d2fbd3433f2a898c35cd4a2c8579a5025863c7bc57c4ffe561a67aebe",
   "text": "时令蔬菜咖喱：选用新鲜采摘的蔬菜，并以适合不同体质（dosha）的香料调味。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d7a3d07f98f3b4f9a13a",
   "sourceHash": "d7a3d07f98f3b4f9a13a7d1944507a2acba36eebdc592e7970360e5826db0e92",
   "text": "可持续发展与阿育吠陀",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5f4f75d90c14e0f7259f",
   "sourceHash": "5f4f75d90c14e0f7259f2e309dcdb376677d2f9fdc812088732c8807db0c05f6",
   "text": "Kairali 对阿育吠陀的坚持不仅体现在食材采购上。有机种植方法和可持续的做法使食材不含化学品和农药，保留其天然的普拉纳（prana，生命能量）。这不仅提升了食物的药用价值，也契合集团对环境负责的理念。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_79ca14e230e24a15545e",
   "sourceHash": "79ca14e230e24a15545e9bb4f194a9bbb9a474cafa77e92928952e5eb263a0ff",
   "text": "Kairali – 阿育吠陀疗愈村的阿育吠陀饮食，体现了自然与传统的疗愈力量。它将美味、营养与治疗益处完美结合，旨在配合院内的康复疗法与生活方式调理。患者在住院期间接纳阿育吠陀饮食，可带来深刻的改变，为更健康、更平衡的生活铺平道路。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source 'retreat’s wellness therapies' rendered as 院内的康复疗法 (clinical register); 'their stay' rendered with 患者 (patients) for clarity."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_9e117afa24e92ef76e4f",
   "sourceHash": "9e117afa24e92ef76e4f0cdff7afe6e4cfe5c1aced0654b5948b5dd3e681ba45",
   "text": "本部分介绍阿育吠陀中称为潘查卡玛（Panchkarma）的疗法类别，重点阐述其意义与应用。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_0d458099c5966f45da5e",
   "sourceHash": "0d458099c5966f45da5e4ad6bbe8dcdbf15b7da784f53f03367c41e06dfeda08",
   "text": "什么是潘查卡玛（Panchkarma）？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5ef7c27f3feff30f9252",
   "sourceHash": "5ef7c27f3feff30f92527864e8bb90658ac4eb4d20b692e0fdb9173a8350960b",
   "text": "阿育吠陀为世界带来了许多贡献。这些贡献改变了人类的生活方式，使人们从疾病缠身的世界走向完全健康的世界成为可能。阿育吠陀的重要性不言而喻，在替代医学领域无疑处于领先地位。阿育吠陀之所以具有非凡的功效，可归因于其多元的特性以及其各个分支——这些分支使人们能够根据所患疾病对症用药，从而彻底清除体内任何疾病的根源。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source contains strong efficacy claims ('eradicating the root of any disease entirely', 'world perfectly healthy'); translated faithfully without strengthening — recommend clinical review (Dr. Deepu John)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1cb28d2d2b6df40add93",
   "sourceHash": "1cb28d2d2b6df40add9349b0924abca8461c88368efca6a27cfeea33949fc423",
   "text": "在这些分支中，最负盛名的或许是阿育吠陀的",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment; 'of Ayurveda' from the following unit moved here for Chinese word order."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5b5dab81dc093f8dc4da",
   "sourceHash": "5b5dab81dc093f8dc4da7632f40240f06d32d0e95fceb9205e782c7381d825ca",
   "text": "潘查卡玛疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_637ade522dc94d93eb34",
   "sourceHash": "637ade522dc94d93eb345013c29a7910c3b1b01bfcd33ef85832cc79a5491567",
   "text": "。潘查卡玛（Panchkarma）一词字面意思是“五种行动”，名副其实，因为这一疗法依靠五种调控身体的基本行动，即催吐、导泻、尼鲁汉（Niruham）、阿努瓦桑（Anuvaasan）和纳斯亚姆（Nasyam）。从某种意义上说，潘查卡玛疗法是大多数阿育吠陀疗法赖以建立的支柱。阿育吠陀的所有风格和方法，都在某种程度上受到这些基本行动的启发或由其衍生而来。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment; 'of Ayurveda' moved into the preceding unit for Chinese word order."
   ]
  }
 ]
}
